{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0233"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/olympics","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/zz-r2-sport-games__olympics.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",580],["+","No swimmer has ruled these distances like the American Katie Ledecky: at the 2015 World Championships in Kazan she won all four individual freestyle titles from 200 m upwards – 200, 400, 800 and 1500 m – and she won the Olympic 800 m four times in a row, from London 2012 to Paris 2024. "],["=",168],["-","1900;"],["+","1900."],["=",1],["+","In its earliest form, in England around 1870, players sat on barrels painted to look like horses and struck the ball with mallets – a polo on water, which is where the name comes from – so the answer to what they rode is: on barrels; "],["=",277]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",528],["+","Niemand hat diese Strecken so beherrscht wie die Amerikanerin Katie Ledecky: Bei der WM 2015 in Kasan gewann sie alle vier Einzeltitel im Freistil ab 200 m – über 200, 400, 800 und 1500 m –, und den olympischen 800-m-Lauf gewann sie viermal in Folge, von London 2012 bis Paris 2024. "],["=",144],["-","gespielt;"],["+","gespielt."],["=",1],["+","In seiner frühesten Form, um 1870 in England, saßen die Spieler auf Fässern, die wie Pferde bemalt waren, und schlugen den Ball mit Schlägern – ein Polo im Wasser, daher der Name; geritten wurde also auf Fässern; "],["=",259]]}]},
